OL,3,GNEWSAPodcaster dropped from Christmas
OL,4,Alights event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA podcaster with over a million
OL,7,Fsubscribers has been dropped from a
OL,8,FChristmas lights switch-on event after
OL,9,Fa city council reviewed his past
OL,10,F"published content".
OL,12,FJack Dean, known as JaackMaate, was
OL,13,Fselected to appear at the event outside
OL,14,FNorwich City Hall on Thursday, 19
OL,15,FNovember.
OL,17,FThe 33-year-old, who is from the city,
OL,18,Fsaid the opportunity was a "bucket list
OL,19,Fdream", but a fortnight later the
OL,20,Finvitation has been withdrawn by the
OL,21,Fcity council.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
